 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pUjlvbdoMLAQ7kNvwEL3A1Q&_nc_oc=Adp1q3HW3wi5_xbzFytwV8vKB-cAZCZAh-tyLGoZXmvSPDim4FDfCt2kT7skDtwWdgM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMyYaaJB7PCXHeu268t04W6ilD4HjIyFLXcgvG62bKV7g&oe=6ADE1DC1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xd2rFTZgvUcQ7kNvwHHA8rW&_nc_oc=AdrkcFCAaPy2GsQf5EsI8t83bvpZQF0-zGE93_0Qv28cfwanPhvXbP7_DOP0O2Q5neQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNAl-MQSCSfgsYVKdF-5qOQ5q78s2dNG9jF6ymHCFT8yw&oe=6ADE2B26"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i65dV7rTJwYQ7kNvwEgim8m&_nc_oc=Adol687VJt7XiIaWwEOA5aGNpig5dooqpPsXccuj4yjeI66hjb-aKUOzLg-HxVQbPH4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNE_EJRhb4g44To_USAZYT769xJFUYVOjWvcM91_nfNGA&oe=6ADDFCDC"}, {"fil